docs {
  # Get App Sliders

  Returns active sliders for the mobile app, sorted by `sortOrder`.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/sliders`

  Authentication is not required.

  ## Frontend Usage

  Use `imageUrl` as the banner image.

  Use `linkUrl` as the click target. If `linkUrl` is an empty string, tapping
  the banner should do nothing.

  Frontend decides the rendered width, height, carousel behavior, crop, and
  responsive layout.

  ## Expected Response

  ```json
  {
    "sliders": [
      {
        "id": "slider_id",
        "title": "Promo banner",
        "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/.../banner.webp",
        "linkUrl": "/services/data"
      }
    ],
    "count": 1
  }
  ```
}
